<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Test Writing</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../styles/test.css" />
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: 'Coiny', sans-serif;
        background-color: #f9f9f9;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px;
      }

      h1 {
        text-align: center;
        color: #888;
      }

      .writing-container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background-color: white;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }

      .options {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
      }

      .option-button {
        padding: 5px 15px;
        border: none;
        background-color: #c1d2c1;
        color: #333;
        border-radius: 5px;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      .prompt-box {
        background-color: #f0f0f0;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .prompt-box h3 {
        margin-top: 0;
      }

      .guide-points {
        margin-top: 10px;
        padding-left: 20px;
      }

      label {
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      textarea {
        width: 100%;
        height: 300px;
        margin-top: 10px;
        padding: 10px;
        font-size: 16px;
        border: 1px solid #ccc;
        border-radius: 8px;
        resize: vertical;
      }

      .submit-button {
        display: block;
        margin: 20px auto 10px;
        padding: 10px 20px;
        font-size: 16px;
        background-color: #9fbfa5;
        color: white;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 6px;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #aaa;
        margin-top: 30px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>Test Writing</h1>
    <div class="writing-container">
      <div class="options">
        <button class="option-button">Writing</button>
        <button class="option-button">Report</button>
      </div>
      <div class="prompt-box">
        <h3>TOPIC:</h3>
        <p>
          Do you agree or disagree with the following statement? <br />
          "Individuals are responsible for their own health. It is not a doctor's responsibility to prevent illness."
        </p>
        <div class="guide-points">
          <p><strong>Guiding questions:</strong></p>
          <ul>
            <li>What are the benefits of using preventive care?</li>
            <li>Should the government or medical professionals be involved in individual choices?</li>
            <li>How do personal habits influence health outcomes?</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <label for="writing-answer">Your answer:</label>
      <textarea id="writing-answer" placeholder="Write your essay here..."></textarea>
      <button class="submit-button">Submit</button>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      Your response will not be saved
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
